  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed change of use of the existing retail unit into a takeaway, by reason of its location and its short distance to a school, would be contrary to London Plan Policy E9, the emerging Local Plan Policy TC5 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed change of use of the existing retail unit into a takeaway, by reason of its design, location, operation hours, the absence of Delivery and Servicing Plan, noise mitigation measures and technical air quality documents, would have a serious and adverse effect on the local transport network and the amenity enjoyed by occupants of neighbouring properties including upper floor residential dwellings, resulting poor air quality, noise, safety and disturbance issues, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1; CC2; EQ4, EQ5; EQ7; EC2 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed rear extension, by reason of its cumulative depth, position, size, scale, design and appearance, would be an inappropriate development for a locally listed building in a Conservation Area, failing to maintain and enhance the appearance and character of this Conservation Area, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1; CC2; CC4 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework."
